That's why I wrote little rather than not at all.

Red molds can be killed with missiles.  All of the other examples are
rare until the mid game.  A player who takes gaining intrinsics as a
goal in the early and mid games will have fire resistance by the time
they become common.  This makes it good strategy to gain intrinsics
whenever possible and to put some amount of effort into it.  Poison
resistance is arguably the most needed intrinsic, fire resistance may
be the next easiest to gain as well as the most valuable later in the
game.

